Dear {!Contact.FirstName} {!Contact.LastName},<br /><br />

Thank you for contacting us. We have received your email and are working on responding to you as soon as possible.<br /><br />

However, one or more of your attachments is not an acceptable file type or exceeds our maximum receipt size. Attachments can be a maximum of 5MB each, or 25MB total per email.<br /><br />

Please reply to this email with your attachment(s). We accept the following attachment types:<br />
Microsoft Word (.doc or .docx)<br />
Microsoft Excel (.xls or .xlsx)<br />
Image (.jpg, .jpeg, .gif, .png)<br />
Adobe PDF (.pdf)<br />
Text (.txt)<br /><br /><br />

<i>Please note that we do not accept .eml files at this time.<i/>
